  "title": "Sasol Foundation invites applications for 2027 bursaries",
  "summary": "The Sasol Foundation is inviting applications for its 2027 bursary programme, offering all-inclusive undergraduate bursaries to academically talented learners and students from Sasol's local communities, children of Sasol employees, and children of Sasol Khanyisa shareholders. The Foundation's bursaries aim to expand access to tertiary education for learners and students from low-income and missing middle households. Applications for the 2027 intake will be open from 1 August to 23 August 2026.",
